<body>
    <h1>Employee Access Today</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"EmployeeAccessToday-High-levelAccessManagementFlow">High-=
level Access Management Flow</h1>
<p>Three scenarios:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b053b3c4-b307-401a-b235-eecc4d336d97">Employee new / mod.=
&nbsp;access requests</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"730f5bf9-6e4a-40b3-8321-8a5798f4cc95">Ongoing monitoring<=
/li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6de3380a-1f56-421c-b350-ddcbafd0629b">Employee departures=
</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"EmployeeAccessToday-Employeeonboarding&amp;mods">Employee onboard=
ing &amp; mods</h3>
<p>Entry point:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3647b1f8-3d25-4e44-baba-e64751143b56">myIT (ServiceNow)</=
li>
</ul>
<p>Steps:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2dae21ee-aa48-47c9-9371-120c4050652a">Manager / employee =
submits request for each app in myIT</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f33105f3-6f05-4eb1-abf8-131aefa08c4d">Each app will have =
differences in how the user profiles are implemented, due to the nature of =
the different capabilities, but the profiles should accurately control empl=
oyee entitlements (no more, no less)=20
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"5cdcc0e9-489d-410b-846e-40b83d9b9d63">For Compass Legac=
y today, employees select department-based profiles (technically role-based=
) to ensure function-specific profiles and remains consistent for everyone =
in that department<br><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confl=
uence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image conflue=
nce-content-image-border" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"249" width=3D"391" =
src=3D"8896243416d3b377e0211bc1351411706f39f4ccf833536bcbae38c182c33677" da=
ta-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/2519580939/image-2025-12-17_10-13-52.=
png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1765984432400&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unr=
esolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2519581611" data-lin=
ked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-li=
nked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-12-17_10-13-52.png" data-base-url=
=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" da=
ta-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2519580939" data-linked-resource-contain=
er-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span><span class=3D"confluence-e=
mbedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"conflue=
nce-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border" draggable=3D"false" hei=
ght=3D"249" width=3D"265" src=3D"98305225a8f56580f6e496f131b78fa46c64c5e485=
695c148aae6216433d327d" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/2519580939/=
image-2025-12-17_11-12-59.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1765987979=
573&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-=
id=3D"2519582852" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-t=
ype=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-12-17_1=
1-12-59.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-con=
tent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2519580939" da=
ta-linked-resource-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span><=
/li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8eff81b4-8b67-49cf-bbc8-5d1d0a4053f2">Requests are routed=
 to the user admin group if not automated for user setup configuration=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"3ad7eb59-1d44-4191-83d0-526c09c65cea">Requests are rout=
ed to the SAA Team for Compass configuration within Compass security portal=
</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"04c3b29f-568c-4bcb-b76a-fa064ceec9f5">Compass Legacy cr=
edentials are distributed to the employee&nbsp;:warning:&nbsp; this is offs=
ide today!</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d0ce4b90-025f-418c-8909-c2c573851ccc">Request fulfillment=
 comes with notification in myIT</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"51939715-c039-4ae9-872b-1954a6bd9a41">TBC - not sure how =
IIQ works with this, I believe this is synced with IIQ so that request mana=
gement can also be handled within IIQ</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"EmployeeAccessToday-Ongoingmonitoring">Ongoing monitoring</h3>
<p>Entry Point: for critical applications and any other applications that a=
re IIQ integrated, oversight is performed in IIQ.</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"226" width=3D"468" src=3D"39cda43a5565=
90fa0ceaa3ef1605e87853ac9310077a94cc746aeb34c82b4a21" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/2519580939/image-2025-12-17_11-16-42.png?version=3D1&amp=
;modificationDate=3D1765988202395&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-cou=
nt=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2519582881" data-linked-resource-versio=
n=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defau=
lt-alias=3D"image-2025-12-17_11-16-42.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bn=
c.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-=
container-id=3D"2519580939" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"8" ta=
bindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrappe=
r confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image =
confluence-content-image-border" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"211" width=
=3D"468" src=3D"d6e6fc9ef5a0b0241fac46d5f7a9be93a8b7e194b7f1b7f1a81e1752008=
1576d" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/2519580939/image-2025-12-17_=
11-21-24.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1765988484758&amp;api=3Dv2"=
 data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2519582933"=
 data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment=
" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-12-17_11-21-24.png" data=
-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"imag=
e/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2519580939" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span></p>
<p>Steps:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f605cff4-8a82-4c39-b9dd-8b6f056890ce">Manager can at anyt=
ime access employee access details in IIQ for ad-hoc inquiries</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cb2644ed-2e85-4400-8820-dc7fec60a390">Several types of ca=
ll to actions (with email notifications) are provided to the manager to sup=
port ongoing oversight=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"f836582c-fccd-472c-b486-a128846cdc5c">Request approvals=
</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"45f81920-34c8-4399-8bbb-a54ad586dcba">Regular access re=
views</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"10744b5c-746a-4d1d-83c2-af4c7065fddc">Policy violations=
</li>
  </ol></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"EmployeeAccessToday-Employeeoffboarding">Employee offboarding</h3=
>
<p>Entry point:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"76650e49-d2b6-46ce-b3e0-471be3940205">For non-urgent depa=
rtures, manager raises myIT ticket for employee offboarding=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"4313943f-7f7c-4c7c-9482-1f5ca86e0122">Single ticket wou=
ld take care of all employee apps + employee AD profile</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"d75a6bd5-08c1-439e-b364-8f9d50251fd5">Changes will be r=
eflected in IIQ</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3939bff9-985d-477a-8c8e-8b3787de10cd">For urgent departur=
es, manager disables employee profile in IIQ for any apps tied to the emplo=
yee AD profile=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"6a9087c0-c9ff-4654-b4e2-aaa0c25b0e4d">Other critical ap=
ps not linked - it is the responsibility of the manager to raise escalated =
requests to relevant app teams to shut down those specific profiles (e.g. n=
ew Compass)</li>
  </ol></li>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"EmployeeAccessToday-AppCapabilitiestoFacilitateEmployeeAccessMana=
gement">App Capabilities to Facilitate Employee Access Management</h1>
<p>Principles:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"08264f63-e0a5-4b1f-a9f0-624d53ceafaf">Line managers are r=
esponsible for security posture (overseeing accesses) of their employees</l=
i>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a264ea02-356f-40c7-8796-e2ee54ff98e1">Application custodi=
ans are responsible for security posture (enabling correct access) of their=
 applications</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8722126d-8729-4d97-8e7c-5b155093c55c">Observes least priv=
ilege</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c6cb7393-d6c9-4c63-8f8a-e0713cd60dc5">Full audit trail is=
 maintained&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"202a3efa-4187-4037-be1a-5e59833f9505">Centralization of u=
ser profile oversight</li>
</ul>
<p>See:</p>
<ul>
 <li><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs.sharepoint.com/si=
tes/securite/SitePages/en/Norme-Gestion-des-acc%C3%A8s.aspx?OR=3DTeams-HL&a=
